<title>SOUTH KOREA: HYUNDAI MOTOR FIRST HALF NET FALLS.</title>
<headline>HYUNDAI MOTOR FIRST HALF NET FALLS.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>	 (in billion won unless stated)</p>
<p>    Share (won)		 581	vs   1,150</p>
<p>    Net			    28.16   vs	51.64</p>
<p>    Profit before tax	  28.16   vs	51.64</p>
<p>    Turnover		   5,415.34  vs   5,555.77</p>
<p>Note - Hyundai Motor, South Korea's largest carmaker and flagship unit of the Hyundai Group, said net profit and pre-tax profit were the same because the company's taxes would be paid in the second half.</p>
</text>
